                          >
                          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-industrial-600">
                            💡 Simples Nacional: geralmente 0%
                          </p>
                        </div>

                        <div>
                          <label for="pis_rate" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-industrial-900 mb-1">
                            PIS (%)
